From 00b6c05e91864d54544eb5bd60169549a0a0d837 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Ott <cott@tapir.caltech.edu>
Date: Wed, 10 Jul 2013 23:50:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] * Major bug fix in EOS_Omni/nuc_eos. In the code
 (before the fix),   offending specific internal energies where limited and
 the EOS   returned seemingly fine, but thermodynamically inconsistent data.

  This has been fixed. This fix also makes isolated microphysical NS
  simulations not work anymore. Why this is the case, we are still
  investigating
---
